flowchart TB
  User[Office devices] --> VPN[Tailscale / office VPN]
  Webhooks[Telegram / optional WAHA webhooks] --> Caddy[Caddy TLS edge]
  VPN --> Caddy
  Caddy --> App[Hawa Desk + Hono API]
  Caddy --> Studio[HyCanvas pinned]
  App --> Postgres[(PostgreSQL + pgvector)]
  App --> Restate[Restate]
  Restate --> Worker[TypeScript workflow workers]
  Worker --> Postgres
  Worker --> Studio
  Worker --> GPU[Optional GPU host\nComfyUI + Qwen retrieval]
  Worker --> Providers[Evaluated external models]
  Worker --> Google[Google Drive + Sheets]
  App -. OTLP .-> Phoenix[Phoenix]
  Worker -. OTLP .-> Phoenix
  Postgres --> Backup[pgBackRest + encrypted off-site]
  App --> FileBackup[restic source/config backup]
